{
  "contract": "duplicate-score-vectors",
  "version": 1,
  "enforcedBy": "backend/tests/test_artisan_duplicates_scoring.py",
  "whatThisIs": [
    "The duplicate-artisan scorer, pinned pair by pair. Identical in the designer portal and the Field",
    "Repository; only pytest reads it, because the server is the only scorer (no web or Android port).",
    "Each side is a flat profile: name, localName, gender, dateOfBirth, phone, state, district, place,",
    "village, craftId, craftCode, aadhaarFingerprint, pehchanCardNumber, remoteArtisanId.",
    "expect.score is the score before the show threshold (null when the pair is not considered at all:",
    "names under half alike and nothing definitive). It is rounded to two decimals after adding 1e-9.",
    "expect.band is null below 0.60 (not stored). expect.reasons are the reason codes in order.",
    "Trigrams are pg_trgm's: each word padded with two spaces in front and one behind; similarity is the",
    "Jaccard of the two sets."
  ],
  "vectors": [
    {
      "name": "honorific dropped, same district",
      "a": {
        "name": "Shri Ramesh Kumar",
        "state": "Rajasthan",
        "district": "Jaipur"
      },
      "b": {
        "name": "Ramesh Kumar",
        "state": "Rajasthan",
        "district": "Jaipur"
      },
      "expect": {
        "score": 0.7,
        "band": "POSSIBLE",
        "reasons": [
          "NAME",
          "DISTRICT"
        ]
      }
    },
